<title>INDIA: Indian 364-day t-bill cut-off price unchanged.</title>
<headline>Indian 364-day t-bill cut-off price unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Wednesday it maintained the cut-off price at 90.64 rupees at its fortnightly auction of 364-day treasury bills held earlier on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>The RBI said in a statement it received 13 bids for 3.2 billion rupees of which it accpeted 10 for 2.9 billion. The weighted-average price worked out to 90.65 rupees, it said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
